WEBVTT

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.520
What are you doing?

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:38.030
I've gone ahead to the cafe in the lobby - Shinozuka

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:59.590
nemuri nasai ima wa tada

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:59.590
Sleep, for now

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:06.500
watashi no naka de doko ni mo ikanai de

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:06.500
Inside of me, and don't go anywhere

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:27.510
madoromi no fuchi de yureteru gunjou iro no yo

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:27.510
Through the slumbering ultramarine sky

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:33.030
majiwaru koto no nai hoshi wo sagashiteru

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:33.030
I am searching for stars that will never cross

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:40.730
anata wo motomeru yubisaki yami ni samayotte

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:40.730
These fingertips search for you, but are lost in darkness

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:49.610
mogaite mo nukedesenai ai no umi ni oboreteku

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:49.610
I try but I can't escape, and I drown in the sea of love

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:57.500
yawaranai toiki ni kokoro sae mo furueru

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:57.500
Your tender sigh makes my heart tremble

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:03.120
karamaru utsukushi kumo no ito no you

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:03.120
Seemingly entangled in the beautiful strands of a spider web

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:07.610
ugokenai no watashi wo yurushite

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:07.610
I cannot move, please forgive me

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:10.940
anata no ude ni dakarete nemuru

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:10.940
I am sleeping with your arms around me

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.160
nani mo kamo sutetatte ii

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.160
I don't mind losing anything else

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:21.690
ii kono mama no maboroshi nante zukuru no wa yamete

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:21.690
Stop pretending that you are a good girl

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:25.150
hontou no watashi wo mitsukete

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:25.150
Find the real me

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:31.230
zutto matteru

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:31.230
I'll be waiting forever

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:40.610
I went ahead and ate first.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:44.610
Go ahead if you'd like to order something, Fujii-san.

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:47.810
Umm... so they have breakfast here?

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.280
They do not.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:57.420
Page 16
Thinking back to when one was young,
There are things so embarrassing it 
makes one writhe in agony.
Compared to that...

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:03.780
I'm thankful for you, Shinozuka-san.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.450
If you hadn't destroyed the letter...

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:16.550
I wouldn't have been able to meet Yuki on Christmas Eve.

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:23.900
My feelings

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:21.380
I do not understand what you are saying.

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:23.990
are still the same

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.860
therefore

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.860
You're my savior-goddess.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.820
Is this your way of saying thank you?

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:30.480
Not really... I'm not really expecting anything in return...

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:33.420
You went to see the concert, did you not?

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:34.610
That is Yuki's-

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:37.560
-reality. Am I right?

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:38.420
-future.

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:40.910
And, I happen to be a hindrance!

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:42.510
I don't understand.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.790
I don't understand at all.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:49.500
So, explain to me, just like you have every time.

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:51.640
You're being unreasonable.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:52.620
Really?

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:56.090
In that case, I'll do just that.

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:58.520
Nanase-kun, hurry!

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.970
Uncle, uncle!

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.720
My... my fault...

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:09.520
What the hell are you doing?! Call an ambulance!

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.600
Turn off the gas first!

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:21.980
Music festival?

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:26.100
Yes, it opens every year at the end of February, hosted by Touou Television.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.800
Ah, I've heard about it.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.680
Venus, the bright star.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.170
The Venus Music Festival.

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:33.010
The bright morning star.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:37.380
It's a festival that decides tomorrow's stars limited only to young female singers.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.310
I watch it often. But...

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:40.440
Well, so,

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.990
Yuki's entering?

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:45.970
It hasn't been decided yet.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:49.900
She applied, but we do not know whether she will be accepted or not.

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:52.860
After all, Yuki-san has only released one single so far.

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:53.790
If she gets in then-

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.210
It'll be a huge career boost.

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:59.920
If she gets in, it doesn't mean that her career as a star will be secured,

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:04.020
but her influence will sweep through the current generation like a huge wind,

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:06.700
and if she manages to get a prize...

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.900
Amazing.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:12.900
This event will truly test the ability of our production company,

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:15.270
but, above all, the greatest obstruction is...

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.930
That's right, did Rina... san, ever-

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:20.330
She never participated. Not once.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.360
Is that so...

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:26.750
She had two chances to claim prizes, but she was scheduled for other jobs.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.150
Was that of her own will?

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:30.150
Who knows? I wonder.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.930
So it was Ogata-san's idea?

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.390
That much is certain.

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:34.310
But why?

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:37.530
"There is no need to interact with a bunch of inferiors."

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:38.770
Inferiors?

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.320
It's a contest of influence.

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:45.610
In that case, he wouldn't give her his consent this time, either.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:47.550
About that...

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.410
Give me the information regarding the Venus Festival.

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:58.290
We can still make it, right?

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:02.010
So basically, he changed his mind?

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.320
I don't understand.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:04.840
It's not like him.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:07.550
It is. It's just like Ogata-san to do that.

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.280
I mean, he's rather unpredictable.

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:10.740
Suddenly, after that...

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:13.410
It's time to exploit our victory.

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:15.140
After... that?

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:19.350
If it's Rina-chan we're talking about, she'll get in for sure.

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:23.790
And if they perform together, Yuki will...

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:24.420
That's impossible.

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:29.730
Each production company may only send one artist.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:33.500
It's a convention that cannot be broken.

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:35.700
So her opponent is...

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.670
My precious Yuki, please-

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:40.710
Does Yuki know about this?

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:43.040
Of course not, if you think about it.

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:45.070
That's true.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:46.740
She never really mentioned anything about it.

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:48.530
Now do you understand?

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:50.060
So about the festival-

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:51.400
You still don't understand.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:55.260
It's about time you accepted it?

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:57.730
That this love is over.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:02.790
Shinozuka-sama, there's someone on the telephone for you.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.900
Please relay the message that I've already left.

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:11.550
Shinozuka-san.

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:13.500
Let's go.

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:14.740
I'll drive you.

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:19.690
I'll take my time in going home.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:22.840
Are you members of his family?

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:24.770
No, but...

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:27.360
I've already contacted his son,

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:29.830
by leaving him a message on his answering machine...

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:34.210
Answering machine? Busy isn't he, since it's New Year's.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:40.620
Touya's dad was left to our care...

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.290
but for cooking to...

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.690
What on earth am I doing?

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.300
What am I going to say to Touya?

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:48.710
Stop sulking.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.430
Don't make me regret it.

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:55.050
Yuunagi Central Road

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.420
First come first serve! First come first serve!

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:00.410
There's more inside!

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.600
You definitely won't be ripped off!

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:05.280
Don't push, don't push now...

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.010
Rina... chan.

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:49.660
No matter how many copies I have...

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:56.740
The shop will reopen on the 5th - Happy New Year

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:17.990
So I've been summoned here by a mere painting, huh?

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:21.450
Is this what they call "the perfect opportunity"?

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:25.580
Thank you for being here for me, Frankie.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:28.960
What's with that look?

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:32.250
You can see that I'm about to collapse?

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:41.170
Hello? Touya?

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:43.700
I'm out, please leave your-

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.810
Hello? This is Nanase.

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:48.790
I've called many times, but...

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:52.230
Um... I'm in Shiritsu Hospital right now.

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:56.320
This morning, your father's condition worsened...

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:59.750
Please come as soon as you hear this message.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.510
I'm sorry.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.510
We'll be with him.

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:20.510
Sorry for the wait!

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:22.680
Please excuse me.

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:24.890
Yayoi-san, what's wrong?

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:27.460
No, nothing's wrong.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:28.130
But--

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:29.650
We better hurry.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.740
What did the doctor say?

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:07.930
Oh, yeah.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:11.460
He said that his blood pressure was quite high.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:17.040
I mean, it's the new year, he got to go home, and you two were with him...

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:19.410
My dad got excited.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:20.930
Uncle...

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:23.450
He also said everything is fine.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:27.820
Since he needs to go through an examination, the operation might be delayed a little...

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:34.560
Where's Akira?

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:35.840
I had him go home.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.320
I see.

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.320
He seemed very distressed,

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:43.210
and said something about not being able to face you, so he...

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:47.120
Why didn't

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:47.120
Why didn't

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:46.570
Don't worry, some things are inevitable.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:47.930
Misaki-san

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:47.930
Misaki-san

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:47.930
Fujii-kun...

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:52.370
go home too?

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:52.370
Oh, Yuki's manager, whom I met here on Christmas Eve...

00:11:52.370 --> 00:12:00.800
What do

00:11:52.370 --> 00:12:00.800
What do

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.150
I saw her at Echoes the other day,

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:56.860
when you weren't around.

00:11:56.630 --> 00:12:00.800
you know?

00:11:56.630 --> 00:12:00.800
you know?

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:58.100
She goes there from time to time,

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:00.800
since it's relaxing and there aren't many other customers.

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:02.490
Does Yuki know?

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.130
Know what?

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.790
The owner says she came often to pick you up...

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:08.110
Just once in a while.

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:09.340
Yuki, she...

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:13.260
Well, I mean, we've never got around to talking about this.

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:15.140
She's a nice person, isn't she?

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.590
I thought she was pretty scary,

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:22.940
but not only does she care for Yuki, she cares for you too, doesn't she?

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:23.850
Yeah.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:28.020
Anyway, it doesn't seem like my dad's in danger anymore,

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:29.830
I'm going to make a trip home.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:30.840
What about you?

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:32.990
I'll stay here just a little longer.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:36.000
Why?

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:59.220
Yeah, we found out with the X-ray today.

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:02.480
Yeah, whether it gets removed or not depends on the results of the examination.

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:06.960
Pacemaker? But...

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:11.370
Yeah, visiting... if everyone comes all of a sudden,

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:13.850
Dad will, you know, realize something's wrong.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:19.340
Yeah, I know you're busy too, uncle.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:26.070
Sawakura-san, please don't apologize.

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:30.080
It's my fault for refusing to acknowledge my own limits.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:35.220
Thanks to you, my life has been prolonged.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:38.520
I'm relieved the operation has been delayed...

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:41.160
So they'll insert a caseworker inside me.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.690
Feels like my heart will stop just by thinking about it.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:47.130
Case-? Oh, uncle...

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:51.070
I'm so glad the two of you were here for me.

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:53.310
Get along with Nanase-kun.

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:55.730
I'm sorry!

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:58.300
Forget about that son of mine.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:13:59.890
Yes...

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.900
Please.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.750
I'm sorry, I'm so sorry.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:15.610
It's time for dinner.

00:14:15.610 --> 00:14:17.660
I can't help but think something's weird.

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:20.580
Wouldn't the ball just fall into the sea?

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:23.970
I'll hit the ball back so that it won't fall into the sea, definitely.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:26.130
What if you miss and it falls into the sea?

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.320
Another hundred balls.

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.540
Whoa!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:32.200
I understand. Let's do it.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:32.760
What?

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.510
When it gets warmer, we can come again,

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:38.560
and you can teach me how to play tennis.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:43.580
Hey, Mana-chan.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.560
Why did you go to Touya's place?

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:48.960
Mana-chan?

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:52.120
Geez, A-blood-type people are so-

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:55.560
All right, perk up your ears and listen properly!

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:58.400
I came to visit a friend whose place just happened to be nearby.

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:01.510
I saw his address on his resume before and thought that it would be somewhere close,

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:04.640
My friend wasn't home... she's a girl, obviously,

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:07.510
It seemed like she was out with
her boyfriend, since it was Christmas Eve.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.370
And so I just decided to visit.

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:13.190
Aesop happened to come back right when I got there, so it's not like I waited for him.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:15.200
And he decided it wouldn't be a good idea to talk standing outside, so...

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:22.620
There's no point in having...

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:25.660
... an answering machine if it's not set right.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:32.380
January 5th (Monday)

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:36.110
I'm out, please leave your name and reason for calling after the beep.

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.940
Hello? It's Yuki.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:43.120
Umm... it's kind of embarrassing,

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:46.900
but did you go back to your dad's home, or...

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:48.970
...are you still in the hospital?

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:51.970
How is your dad doing?

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.510
I'm sorry for not visiting him.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.790
The New Year holiday is over too, right?

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:01.160
I've been working the whole time so it's hard to believe,

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:03.560
But I'll be at home tonight,

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.980
So if you're not busy or anything please call me.

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:07.660
And umm...

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.210
Yeah, bye.

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:24.590
Before we enter the main topic of our meeting,

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:28.600
you weren't being followed on your way here, is that right?

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:33.630
Yayoi-san, I'll get it.

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:34.990
Thank you very much.

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:50.320
February 28th - Touou Assembly Hall

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:53.860
The Venus Festival?

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.530
Ooh, I get to save some ink.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.730
Unbelievable.

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:03.090
Have you gone senile, Nii-san?

00:17:03.090 --> 00:17:05.890
You've avoided the subject like the plague up until now.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.170
You don't want to enter?

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:13.360
I do. I've always wanted to.

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:16.270
But, how are we doing this? I thought there was-

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:19.040
A rule which allows only one participant

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:21.370
or group per production company.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:24.280
For a company in such a favorable position as ours,

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:25.840
choosing between you is difficult.

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:29.410
Eh? But, that means-

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:31.900
If that's the case, the solution is simple.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.200
There's no need to hesitate or keep up this facade.

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:37.710
In other words, all this is for Yuki's sake. Am I right?

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:41.130
Rina-chan, I-

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:44.340
Understood. I'll comply with your decision.

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:46.850
Actually, it's the opposite.

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:51.750
From today onwards, I, Ogata Rina, will be...

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.090
...independent from Ogata Productions.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:18:00.130
Oh wow, what is it that you're helping me save now?

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:01.700
The cost of advertising my CDs.

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:06.300
As your final assignment, please, drive me back home.

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:07.400
Y-Yes.

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:10.060
Rina-chan, wait!

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:12.830
Ogata-san!

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:17.090
Rina-chan!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.770
Rina-chan, wait!

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:25.010
Please, listen to what I have to say!

00:18:31.050 --> 00:18:34.730
I never intended to go to whatever music festival or anything-

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:44.990
Sorry.

00:18:57.960 --> 00:18:59.960
Ogata-san, aren't you going to stop her?!

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:02.610
Yayoi-san, what are you doing?

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:06.180
How can you stay so calm, Rina-chan left!

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:07.630
She said she's quitting!

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:08.220
Yuki-san.

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:11.530
Drive me there! Drive me to Rina-chan's place!

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:13.490
Understood.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:20.060
Wait for me down there, I drive the car over.

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:20.940
Okay!

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:29.120
That was your target, wasn't it?

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:31.080
I'm surprised you noticed.

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:36.580
Have you confirmed it was Hiraki-kun?

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:37.770
Most probably.

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:41.880
I wonder what action we should take, with him taking photos of you two.

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:42.960
Yes.

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.590
I can pretend not to notice,

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:48.550
or maybe I'll take legal action.

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:50.030
Is that fine?

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:51.510
Yes, please.

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.060
Are you doing okay?

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:54.930
Of course.

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:56.130
And the youngster?

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:57.730
There's nothing between us.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:01.560
If Yuki is harmed in any way, I won't forgive you.

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:02.480
Yes.

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:08.720
Rina-san will have played part in this.

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:08.310
Please don't destroy my career.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:15.640
This is Ogata speaking.

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:17.520
Ei-chan, it's me.

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:19.430
Ah, it's President Kanzaki.

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:21.800
It's amazing you've been able to follow me all the way here.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:23.670
Can we meet?

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:35.020
President, Menou-san is-

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:23.870
Rina-chan!

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:28.920
Hello? I'm Yuki.

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:32.180
I've been waiting for

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:32.180
I've been waiting for

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:34.840
the sound of your voice when you smile.

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:34.840
the sound of your voice when you smile.

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:34.840
Yuki.

00:22:37.150 --> 00:22:38.130
Yuki!

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:56.090
watashi ni itsumo anata wa yasashii

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:56.090
You have always been kind to me

00:22:57.010 --> 00:23:02.680
sono yasashisa ga fuan ni suru

00:22:57.010 --> 00:23:02.680
But this kindness makes me insecure

00:23:04.850 --> 00:23:11.500
unmei no ito hodokenai you ni

00:23:04.850 --> 00:23:11.500
This string of fate, I'll retie it over and over

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:18.120
nando mo musubi naoshite

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:18.120
So that it will never come loose

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:26.500
tsugi ni au yakusoku dekinai mama

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:26.500
I don't want to hear you say goodbye

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:36.440
wakare no kotoba mada kikitaku wa nai yo

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:36.440
Until we make promises to meet again

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:44.180
aenai yoru ni yume de aetara

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:44.180
Even if we can't meet tonight, 
if I can see you in my dreams

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:52.090
ashita ga tsurakute mo waratte irareru

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:52.090
Even if tomorrow is difficult I'll be able to smile

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:59.550
donna ni tooku hanarete ite mo

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:59.550
No matter how far apart we may become

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:09.520
tsunagatte ireru to shinjite iru

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:09.520
I believe that we will still be connected together

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:22.930
Page 17

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:26.640
There are lies one wants to be exposed.

00:24:26.640 --> 00:24:29.320
There are also truths one does not want to believe in.

00:24:29.320 --> 00:24:31.100
In my case, there is one of each.

00:24:31.800 --> 00:24:33.020
White Album.
